---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang);
---

<section data-demo="bitbucket" lang={lang}>
  <header>
    <p>
      {t(
        "Order app · Jira + Bitbucket Cloud",
        "주문 앱 · Jira + Bitbucket Cloud",
        "注文アプリ · Jira + Bitbucket Cloud",
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>
      {t(
        "Follow the request into the code.",
        "요청에서 코드까지 연결",
        "依頼からコードへたどる",
      )}
    </h2>
  </header>
  <p class="connection" data-connection>
    {t(
      "Prerequisite: connect the Jira site and Bitbucket workspace",
      "전제: Jira 사이트와 Bitbucket workspace 연결",
      "前提：JiraサイトとBitbucket workspaceを接続",
    )}
  </p>
  <div class="trace" data-trace>
    <article class="ticket">
      <span class="artifact-label">01 / Jira</span>
      <code>ORDER-12</code>
      <h3>
        {t("Correct delivery address", "배송 주소 수정", "配送先住所を修正")}
      </h3>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Staff need to fix an address before dispatch.",
          "직원이 발송 전에 주소를 고쳐야 합니다.",
          "店員が発送前に住所を直す必要があります。",
        )}
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="branch">
      <span class="artifact-label">02 / Git</span>
      <code>ORDER-12/address-fix</code>
      <h3>{t("Branch and commits", "브랜치와 커밋", "ブランチとコミット")}</h3>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Carry the same work-item key into development.",
          "같은 작업 키를 개발 작업에도 사용합니다.",
          "同じ作業キーを開発にも使います。",
        )}
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="pr">
      <span class="artifact-label">03 / PR</span>
      <code>ORDER-12</code>
      <h3>
        {t("Review the address fix", "주소 수정 검토", "住所の修正をレビュー")}
      </h3>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Open the linked request, compare the change, then merge.",
          "연결된 요청을 열고 변경을 비교한 뒤 병합합니다.",
          "関連する依頼を開き、変更を比較してマージします。",
        )}
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
  <p class="result" data-result>
    {t(
      "One work-item key connects requirement → branch → review.",
      "작업 키 하나가 요구사항 → 브랜치 → 검토를 연결합니다.",
      "一つの作業キーが要件 → ブランチ → レビューを結びます。",
    )}
  </p>
  <p class="boundary" data-boundary>
    {t(
      "ORDER-12 is fictional. Links need setup and consistent keys; they do not prove correctness. Jira integration is available with other hosts too.",
      "ORDER-12는 가상 예시입니다. 연결 설정과 일관된 키가 필요하며 링크가 정확성을 증명하지는 않습니다. 다른 호스팅도 Jira와 연동합니다.",
      "ORDER-12は架空の例です。設定と一貫したキーが必要で、リンクは正しさの証明ではありません。他のホストにもJira連携があります。",
    )}
  </p>
</section>
<style>
  section {
    container-type: inline-size;
    background: #eaf1f8;
    color: #244263;
    border: 1px solid #8ba1b7;
    padding: clamp(16px, 3vw, 32px);
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  p,
  h2,
  h3 {
    margin: 0;
  }
  header p {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .connection {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border: 1px dashed #57799e;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .trace {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    border-top: 5px solid #244263;
    padding-top: 18px;
  }
  article {
    padding: 18px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #8ba1b7;
  }
  .ticket {
    border-radius: 0 0 24px 0;
  }
  .branch {
    border-left: 5px solid #57799e;
  }
  .pr {
    border-top: 5px solid #244263;
  }
  .artifact-label {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  code {
    display: block;
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-weight: 750;
    padding: 10px;
    border: 2px solid #244263;
    background: #dce8f5;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  article p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .result {
    padding: 18px;
    border-bottom: 3px solid #244263;
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .boundary {
    margin-top: 24px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  @container (max-width:620px) {
    .trace {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      border-top: 0;
      border-left: 5px solid #244263;
      padding: 0 0 0 16px;
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .artifact-label {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
  }
</style>
